              },
              {
                "label": "gck/checks.json"
              }
            ],
            "caveats": [
              "These are retained observations, not a demonstrated count of unique people across publications. Unknown must not become unaffected. The frozen input remains unchanged; the two units are quarantined only in a labeled sensitivity. W99R also retains a source-internal nucleotide notation conflict."
            ]
